---Apply a path-cleaning suggestion
---
---Merges the suggestion's rules into the team's path_cleaning_filters (never overwrites existing rules) and resolves the underlying health issue. Requires project admin, matching the team API's gate on path_cleaning_filters.
---
---`POST /api/projects/{project_id}/web_analytics_path_cleaning_suggestions/{id}/apply/`
---@param input posthog.web_analytics_path_cleaning_suggestions.ApplyWebAnalyticsPathCleaningSuggestionRequest
---@return posthog.web_analytics_path_cleaning_suggestions.ApplyPathCleaningSuggestionResponse? value
---@return distilled.Error? err
function Client:apply_web_analytics_path_cleaning_suggestion(input) end

---Generate path-cleaning suggestions on demand
---
---Samples the team's recent paths, asks the LLM for cleaning rules, validates them against the real paths, and stores the result as a `path_cleaning_suggestions` health issue (replacing any previous active one). Runs even if the team already has rules. Returns the suggestion (or a skip status when there aren't enough paths to suggest from).
---
---`POST /api/projects/{project_id}/web_analytics_path_cleaning_suggestions/generate/`
---@param input posthog.web_analytics_path_cleaning_suggestions.GenerateWebAnalyticsPathCleaningSuggestionRequest
---@return posthog.web_analytics_path_cleaning_suggestions.GeneratePathCleaningSuggestionResponse? value
---@return distilled.Error? err
function Client:generate_web_analytics_path_cleaning_suggestion(input) end

---Preview a path-cleaning suggestion on real paths
---
---Applies the suggestion's rules (in order) to a fresh sample of the team's top paths and returns before/after pairs for the paths that would change. Computed on demand; path samples are never stored. Nothing is modified.
---
---`GET /api/projects/{project_id}/web_analytics_path_cleaning_suggestions/{id}/preview/`
---@param input posthog.web_analytics_path_cleaning_suggestions.PreviewWebAnalyticsPathCleaningSuggestionRequest
---@return posthog.web_analytics_path_cleaning_suggestions.PreviewPathCleaningSuggestionResponse? value
---@return distilled.Error? err
function Client:preview_web_analytics_path_cleaning_suggestion(input) end

